        . SystemCoreClock (CMSIS global variable)
        . RAM_VR          (STM32WL3x RAM virtual registers)
    -in stm32cube/stm32wl3x/drivers/include/Legacy/stm32_hal_legacy.h
      . Guard PAGESIZE definition with #ifndef __ZEPHYR__ as it conflicts with POSIX
